S_Z:TNT1 A 0 A_SpawnItemEx("S_TetrisRock_Z",cos(-pitch)*2,0,32+38+(sin(-pitch)*2),cos(-pitch),0,sin(-pitch),15,1+32+8192)TNT1 A 0 A_SpawnItemEx("S_TetrisRock_Z",cos(-pitch)*2,0,32+38+(sin(-pitch)*2),cos(-pitch)*5,0,sin(-pitch)*5,-15,1+32+8192)stop
